flowchart TB
  start([Preflight from molt]) --> pingAll{Ping .11 .12 .16}
  pingAll -->|fail| netFail[Fix lab network]
  pingAll -->|ok| chkMolt[Docker + repo OK]
  chkMolt --> chkHook{odc-hook\nconnected?}
  chkHook -->|no| fixHook[Fix mTLS / unit / certs]
  chkHook -->|yes| chkSrv[hexa-five:\nunits + :9443 + CLI]
  chkSrv --> chkPi4[rpi-4b:\nunit + IPC + YAML]
  chkPi4 --> chkPi5[rpi-5:\nunit + IPC + YAML]
  chkPi5 --> vpn{VPN peers up?}
  vpn -->|no| fixVpn[Check creds / tunnel]
  vpn -->|yes| evt{Hook counters\nincreased?}
  evt -->|no| fixEvt[Check registry publish]
  evt -->|yes| media{RTSP E2E?}
  media -->|skip| green([Lab ready])
  media -->|run| frames{Frames > 0?}
  frames -->|no| fixMedia[Check GStreamer ports]
  frames -->|yes| green
